@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "zendesk.api"

Feature: DXP Cloud Routing
	Testing the routing of the DXP Cloud ticket to the DXP Engineering group

Teardown:
	* I teardown the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" from zendesk.liferay.com
	* I teardown users with the following userExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| User1 |
	* I teardown organizations with the following organizationExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| Organization1 |

Scenario: DXP Cloud No Region Routing
	End users in the US support region who create requests for the DXP Cloud product and components should have their requests routed to the DXP Cloud US group.

	Given I create an organization with the following values
	| Status           | Approved            |
	| Name             | Organization Name 1 |
	| Tags             | liferay_dxp_cloud   |
	| Shared Tickets   | true                |
	| Shared Comments  | true                |
	| SLA              | Gold                |
	| Tier             | T4                  |
	| External ID      | Organization1       |
	And I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk User1                    |
	| Tags             | osb_customer,osb_kb              |
	| Password         | zendeskqauser                    |
	| Role             | End-user                         |
	| Access           | Organization                     |
	| Email            | zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                |
	| Organization     | Organization Name 1              |
	| Language         | English                          |
	| Time Zone        | Pacific Time (US & Canada)       | 
	| External ID      | User1                            |
	When I create several requests as a user with the email address "zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken" with the following product and component values
	| prd_liferay_dxp_cloud | backup_recovery     |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_cloud | connectivity        |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_cloud | networking          |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_cloud | system_availability |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_cloud | vpn                 |
	Then the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" should be assigned to the group "DXP Cloud - Support"

Scenario: DXP Cloud No Region Routing for FLS Organization
	End users in the US support region with FLS support who create requests for the DXP Cloud product and components should have their requests routed to the DXP Cloud Support group.

